 "emoji": "🌉",
 "sentences": [
  "London’s Battersea Bridge was famously dangerous.",
  "It replaced a ferry service operating since the 16th century.",
  "Originally, the owner wanted a stone bridge but only had money for wood.",
  "The wooden design was poorly built and hazardous for traffic.",
  "Boats constantly crashed into it, forcing repairs with iron girders.",
  "Despite being unpopular, it became the last surviving wooden bridge on the Thames.",
  "Even famous artists like Whistler painted this shaky structure."
